sequenceDiagram
    participant Student as Student Browser
    participant AW as AmmaWallet Frontend (Nfts.tsx)
    participant AWBack as AmmaWallet Backend
    participant HorizIdx as Stellar Indexer
    participant LMS as LMS API

    Student->>AW: Opens NFT Gallery
    AW->>AWBack: GET /api/v1/nfts/owner/<pubKey>
    AWBack->>HorizIdx: Query indexed SEP-50 tokens
    HorizIdx-->>AWBack: [{token:{tokenId,name,image,...},collection:{contractId,...}}]
    AWBack-->>AW: {indexed:{tokens:[]}, classicNfts:[]}
    AW->>LMS: GET /api/v1/credentials/public?wallet=<pubKey>
    LMS-->>AW: {credentials:[{credentialId, sorobanTokenId, courseTitle, courseCode, mintedAt, txHash}]}
    Note over AW: Build Map<sorobanTokenId → LmsCredential>
    Note over AW: For each LMS-contract token,<br/>lookup cred by item.token.tokenId<br/>(falls back to positional for legacy nulls)
    AW-->>Student: NFT cards with LMS overlay<br/>(course title, code, date, Stellar link)
